<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens on dlr, up on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens on dlr, up on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar on Tuesday but strengthened against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling stood at a commercial mean rate of 600.2073 against the dollar from 600.1875 on Monday. Against the pound the shilling traded at a mean rate 961.5351 from 963.1839 on Monday.</p>
</text>
